        <entry key="text" type="xstring" value="peptide level output%%00010%%000101st input table is table %%00010prior any processing%%00010(do not modify this input)%%00010%%00010input tables 2-5 are meant %%00010for different processing %%00010variants that can be %%00010combined into a single %%00010table to be exported%%00010%%00010in case of the same %%00010column names present %%00010in multiple tables, %%00010the columns from %%00010higher located table %%00010will be retained only!"/>
